      "heroTitle": "helfen, danken, gehören",
      "heroImage": "hands",
      "story": [
        "<b>helfen, danken</b> and <b>gehören</b> take one object. That object is a person, and the person is dative. Ask <b>Wem?</b>",
        "<b>Ich helfe dem Patienten. Du hilfst mir.</b> The vowel changes: <b>du hilfst</b>, <b>er hilft</b>. Not helfst.",
        "<b>Ich danke der Patientin.</b> Feminine dative is <b>der</b>, not die. The pronoun is <b>dir</b>, not dich.",
        "<b>Die Tablette gehört dem Patienten.</b> The tablet is the subject. The owner is dative. <b>gehört</b> here is the present of gehören.",
        "Last chapter, <b>geben</b> had a thing as well. These three verbs do not."
      ],
